  "releaseNotes": "v4.9.11: Math.Clamp now works in kernels on all 6 backends (frontend remap to throw-free IntrinsicMath.Clamp); async browser parity (overridable SynchronizeAsync/CopyToCPUAsync core virtuals + real ReduceAsync drain), MemSetToZeroAsync, Wasm TensorView+Half struct-param dispatch, WebGL nested-struct hoisted init, opt-in Wasm host-buffer race detector. Bundles forks 2.0.8.",
